desc:ReaProof Quad Split (2 in, 4 out)
// GOOD reference subject for multichannel plumbing: input L/R pass through on
// outputs 1/2 and are duplicated at exactly half amplitude (-6.02 dB) on
// outputs 3/4. The render pipeline must size the track, the master and the
// output file to the declared out_pin count for channels 3/4 to exist at all.

slider1:0<0,1,1>-unused

in_pin:left input
in_pin:right input
out_pin:left output
out_pin:right output
out_pin:left dup (half)
out_pin:right dup (half)

@sample
spl2 = spl0 * 0.5;
spl3 = spl1 * 0.5;
